# See https://docs.github.com/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# Project-specific local directories
/.plan/
/artifacts/
/builds/
/design/
/publish/

# Project-specific local (and private) files
**/.code_compare
**/.ground_zero
**/*.ground_zero
**/.mcp_file_state.json
**/[Nn][Oo][Tt][Ee][Ss].md
**/[Tt][Oo][Dd][Oo].md
**/*.[Bb][Aa][Tt]
**/*.[Cc][Mm][Dd]
**/*.private.*
**/*.secrets.*
**/CodeSnapshot.txt

# The `launchSettings.json` file is the checked-in template with settings structure only!
# Environment-specific files (launchSettings.<environment>.json) must stay local.
**/launchSettings.*.json
!**/launchSettings.json

# The `appsettings.json` file is the checked-in template with settings structure only!
# Environment-specific files (appsettings.<environment>.json) must stay local.
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.json

